control := {"msg":"Invalid registry","details":{}}
result = violation with input as {"apiVersion":"admissi…
result[_] == control
}
test_error_message_allowed {
result = violation with input as {" apiVersion":"admissi…
result == set()
}
There are eight tests in total: two tests to make sure that the proper error message is returned when
there’s an issue, and six tests covering two use cases for three input types. We’re testing simple pod
definitions, Deployment, and CronJob. To validate success or failure as expected, we have included
definitions that have image attributes that include docker.io and quay.io for each input type. The
